    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在 s 平面右半平面具有零点的传递函数归类为非最小相位传递函数。如果将传递函数的所有零点关于 jω 轴镜像对称，传递函数的幅值特性保持不变，唯一的差异在于相移特性。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Transfer functions with zeros in the right-hand s-plane are classified as nonminimum phase transfer functions. If the zeros of a transfer function are all reflected about the jω-axis, there is no change in the magnitude of the transfer function, and the only difference is in the phase-shift characteristics.",
